  m_Name: lore_l1_patrol
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: RootAccess.Systems::RootAccess.Systems.LoreDefinition
  loreId: lore_l1_patrol
  title: "Jurnal de patrul\u0103 #114"
  body: "Acoperi\u0219urile din Sectorul 7 sunt ale noastre dup\u0103 miezul nop\u021Bii.
    Halden pl\u0103te\u0219te dublu pentru tura de noapte \u0219i nimeni nu \xEEntreab\u0103
    de ce. Regula e simpl\u0103: dac\u0103 vezi pe cineva cu glug\u0103, raportezi
    \xEEnt\xE2i, g\xE2nde\u0219ti dup\u0103."
  titleEn: Patrol log #114
  bodyEn: 'The Sector 7 rooftops are ours after midnight. Halden pays double for
    the night shift and nobody asks why. The rule is simple: if you see someone in
    a hood, report first, think later.'
  levelId: level01
  order: 0
